1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,833
Then, on the glass beside your head, a
soft knock. Tap. Tap. Tap.

2
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:07,367
Hey. It's me. Open the window, man.
It's freezing out here.

3
00:00:07,867 --> 00:00:13,367
Rule six. Don't answer anyone who
knocks on the glass. Not even if they
know your name.

4
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:20,200
You stare at your shoes. The knocking
moves along the car, window by window.
Then it stops. The doors close.

5
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:26,000
The man with the newspaper was facing
the window. Now his seat is empty. The
paper is still on it.
